        336.8,
        140.9,
        341.5
      ],
      "text": "2.\nShri Morarji R. Desai has been sworn in as Prime\nMinister by the Acting President at 3-30 P.M. today,\n24 March, 1977. The Ministry of Home Affairs may kindly\ntake such action as may be considered necessary regarding\nissue of Gazette notifications, etc."
